WEBVTT

00:03:57.440 --> 00:04:00.520
or the evolutionary mechanism
that explains everything.

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:06.160
Instead, every bit of behavior
has multiple levels of causality.

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.200
Let's look at an example.

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:10.040
You have a gun.

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:12.296
There's a crisis going on:

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:14.896
rioting, violence, people running around.

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:18.096
A stranger is running at you
in an agitated state --

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:23.216
you can't quite tell if the expression
is frightened, threatening, angry --

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:26.456
holding something
that kind of looks like a handgun.

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:27.696
You're not sure.

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:29.616
The stranger comes running at you

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:31.376
and you pull the trigger.